peech_prob": 0.1705593764781952}, {"id": 38, "seek": 16262, "start": 162.62, "end": 165.9, "text": " You put a blue to a green, you can make light.", "tokens": [50363, 921, 1234, 257, 4171, 284, 257, 4077, 11, 345, 460, 787, 1657, 13, 50527], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14114866256713868, "compression_ratio": 1.6243093922651934, "no_speech_prob": 0.0067296442575752735}, {"id": 39, "seek": 16262, "start": 165.9, "end": 170.54, "text": " You can put a knob in between.", "tokens": [50527, 921, 460, 1234, 257, 36842, 287, 1022, 13, 50759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14114866256713868, "compression_ratio": 1.6243093922651934, "no_speech_prob": 0.0067296442575752735}, {"id": 40, "seek": 16262, "start": 170.54, "end": 174.14000000000001, "text": " And now you've made a little dimmer.", "tokens": [50759, 843, 783, 345, 1053, 925, 257, 1310, 5391, 647, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14114866256713868, "compression_ratio": 1.6243093922651934, "no_speech_prob": 0.0067296442575752735}, {"id": 41, "seek": 16262, "start": 174.14000000000001, "end": 181.98000000000002, "text": " Switch out the dimmer, the knob, for a pulse module, which is here.", "tokens": [50939, 14645, 503, 262, 5391, 647, 11, 262, 36842, 11, 329, 257, 19445, 8265, 11, 543, 318, 994, 13, 51331], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14114866256713868, "compression_ratio": 1.6243093922651934, "no_speech_prob": 0.0067296442575752735}, {"id": 42, "seek": 16262, "start": 181.98000000000002, "end": 185.3, "text": " And now you've made a little blinker.", "tokens": [51331, 843, 783, 345, 1053, 925, 257, 1310, 21019, 263, 13, 51497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14114866256713868, "compression_ratio": 1.6243093922651934, "no_speech_prob": 0.0067296442575752735}, {"id": 43, "seek": 16262, "start": 185.3, "end": 191.9, "text": " Add this buzzer for some extra punch, and you've created a noise machine.", "tokens": [51497, 3060, 428, 14713, 263, 329, 617, 3131, 10862, 11, 290, 345, 1053, 2727, 257, 7838, 4572, 13, 51827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14114866256713868, "compression_ratio": 1.6243093922651934, "no_speech_prob": 0.0067296442575752735}, {"id": 44, "seek": 19190, "start": 191.9, "end": 193.22, "text": " I'm going to stop then.", "tokens": [50363, 314, 1101, 1016, 284, 2245, 788, 13, 50429], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 45, "seek": 19190, "start": 193.22, "end": 198.38, "text": " So beyond simple play, little bits are actually pretty powerful.", "tokens": [50429, 1406, 3675, 2829, 711, 11, 1310, 10340, 389, 1682, 2495, 3665, 13, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 46, "seek": 19190, "start": 198.38, "end": 202.9, "text": " Instead of having to program, to wire, to solder, little bits allow you to program using", "tokens": [50687, 5455, 286, 1719, 284, 1430, 11, 284, 6503, 11, 284, 42809, 11, 1310, 10340, 1249, 345, 284, 1430, 1262, 50913], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 47, "seek": 19190, "start": 202.9, "end": 204.94, "text": " very simple intuitive gestures.", "tokens": [50913, 845, 2829, 19933, 24621, 13, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 48, "seek": 19190, "start": 204.94, "end": 209.16, "text": " So to make this blink faster or slower, you would just turn this knob and basically make", "tokens": [51015, 1406, 284, 787, 428, 21019, 5443, 393, 13611, 11, 345, 561, 655, 1210, 428, 36842, 290, 6209, 787, 51226], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 49, "seek": 19190, "start": 209.16, "end": 212.18, "text": " it pulse faster or slower.", "tokens": [51226, 340, 19445, 5443, 393, 13611, 13, 51377], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 50, "seek": 19190, "start": 212.18, "end": 215.8, "text": " The idea behind little bits is that it's a growing library.", "tokens": [51377, 383, 2126, 2157, 1310, 10340, 318, 326, 340, 338, 257, 3957, 5888, 13, 51558], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 51, "seek": 19190, "start": 215.8, "end": 219.86, "text": " We want to make every single interaction in the world into a ready-to-use brick.", "tokens": [51558, 775, 765, 284, 787, 790, 2060, 10375, 287, 262, 995, 656, 257, 3492, 12, 1462, 12, 1904, 17214, 13, 51761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.15718504098745492, "compression_ratio": 1.7195571955719557, "no_speech_prob": 0.015940306708216667}, {"id": 52, "seek": 21986, "start": 219.86, "end": 224.34, "text": " Lights, sounds, solar panels, motors, everything should be accessible.", "tokens": [50363, 22661, 11, 5238, 11, 6591, 13043, 11, 24699, 11, 2279, 815, 307, 9857, 13, 50587], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 53, "seek": 21986, "start": 224.34, "end": 227.82000000000002, "text": " We've been giving little bits to kids and seeing them play with them, and it's been", "tokens": [50587, 775, 1053, 587, 3501, 1310, 10340, 284, 3988, 290, 4379, 606, 711, 351, 606, 11, 290, 340, 338, 587, 50761], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 54, "seek": 21986, "start": 227.82000000000002, "end": 229.14000000000001, "text": " an incredible experience.", "tokens": [50761, 281, 8082, 1998, 13, 50827], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 55, "seek": 21986, "start": 229.14000000000001, "end": 233.26000000000002, "text": " The nicest thing is how they start to understand the electronics around them from every day", "tokens": [50827, 383, 9200, 395, 1517, 318, 703, 484, 923, 284, 1833, 262, 17075, 1088, 606, 422, 790, 1110, 51033], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 56, "seek": 21986, "start": 233.26000000000002, "end": 234.84, "text": " that they don't learn at schools.", "tokens": [51033, 326, 484, 836, 470, 2193, 379, 4266, 13, 51112], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 57, "seek": 21986, "start": 234.84, "end": 240.42000000000002, "text": " For example, how a nightlight works, or why an elevator door stays open, or how an iPod", "tokens": [51112, 1114, 1672, 11, 703, 257, 1755, 2971, 2499, 11, 393, 1521, 281, 20932, 3420, 14768, 1280, 11, 393, 703, 281, 26915, 51391], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 58, "seek": 21986, "start": 240.42000000000002, "end": 242.54000000000002, "text": " responds to touch.", "tokens": [51391, 20067, 284, 3638, 13, 51497], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 59, "seek": 21986, "start": 242.54000000000002, "end": 244.78000000000003, "text": " We've also been taking little bits to design schools.", "tokens": [51497, 775, 1053, 635, 587, 2263, 1310, 10340, 284, 1486, 4266, 13, 51609], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 60, "seek": 21986, "start": 244.78000000000003, "end": 249.02, "text": " So for example, we've had designers with no experience with electronics whatsoever start", "tokens": [51609, 1406, 329, 1672, 11, 356, 1053, 550, 15441, 351, 645, 1998, 351, 17075, 16014, 923, 51821], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1277179718017578, "compression_ratio": 1.7993527508090614, "no_speech_prob": 0.791208803653717}, {"id": 61, "seek": 24902, "start": 249.06, "end": 251.74, "text": " to play with little bits as a material.", "tokens": [50365, 284, 711, 351, 1310, 10340, 355, 257, 2587, 13, 50499], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17959484611589885, "compression_ratio": 1.5655737704918034, "no_speech_prob": 0.015611681155860424}, {"id": 62, "seek": 24902, "start": 251.74, "end": 255.74, "text": " Here you see, with felt and paper water bottles, we have Jordi making ...", "tokens": [50499, 3423, 345, 766, 11, 351, 2936, 290, 3348, 1660, 14096, 11, 356, 423, 38317, 72, 1642, 2644, 50699], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17959484611589885, "compression_ratio": 1.5655737704918034, "no_speech_prob": 0.015611681155860424}, {"id": 63, "seek": 24902, "start": 255.74, "end": 266.26, "text": " A few weeks ago, we took little bits to RISD and gave them to some designers with no experience", "tokens": [50699, 317, 1178, 2745, 2084, 11, 356, 1718, 1310, 10340, 284, 45698, 35, 290, 2921, 606, 284, 617, 15441, 351, 645, 1998, 51225], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17959484611589885, "compression_ratio": 1.5655737704918034, "no_speech_prob": 0.015611681155860424}, {"id": 64, "seek": 24902, "start": 266.26, "end": 272.14, "text": " in engineering whatsoever, just cardboard, wood, and paper, and told them, make something.", "tokens": [51225, 287, 8705, 16014, 11, 655, 26819, 11, 4898, 11, 290, 3348, 11, 290, 1297, 606, 11, 787, 1223, 13, 51519], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17959484611589885, "compression_ratio": 1.5655737704918034, "no_speech_prob": 0.015611681155860424}, {"id": 65, "seek": 24902, "start": 272.14, "end": 278.26, "text": " Here's an example of a project they made, a motion-activated confetti cannonball.", "tokens": [51519, 3423, 338, 281, 1672, 286, 257, 1628, 484, 925, 11, 257, 6268, 12, 33106, 1013, 24851, 21202, 1894, 13, 51825], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17959484611589885, "compression_ratio": 1.5655737704918034, "no_speech_prob": 0.015611681155860424}, {"id": 66, "seek": 27826, "start": 278.26, "end": 281.74, "text": " Oh, wait, this is actually my favorite project.", "tokens": [50363, 3966, 11, 4043, 11, 428, 318, 1682, 616, 4004, 1628, 13, 50537], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 67, "seek": 27826, "start": 281.74, "end": 293.02, "text": " It's a lobster made of Play-Doh that's afraid of the dark.", "tokens": [50537, 632, 338, 257, 43657, 925, 286, 3811, 12, 35, 1219, 326, 338, 7787, 286, 262, 3223, 13, 51101], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 68, "seek": 27826, "start": 293.02, "end": 296.62, "text": " To these non-engineers, little bits became another material.", "tokens": [51101, 1675, 777, 1729, 12, 18392, 364, 11, 1310, 10340, 2627, 1194, 2587, 13, 51281], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 69, "seek": 27826, "start": 296.62, "end": 300.14, "text": " Electronics became just another material, and we want to make this material accessible", "tokens": [51281, 27828, 2627, 655, 1194, 2587, 11, 290, 356, 765, 284, 787, 428, 2587, 9857, 51457], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 70, "seek": 27826, "start": 300.14, "end": 301.14, "text": " to everyone.", "tokens": [51457, 284, 2506, 13, 51507], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 71, "seek": 27826, "start": 301.14, "end": 302.56, "text": " So little bits is open source.", "tokens": [51507, 1406, 1310, 10340, 318, 1280, 2723, 13, 51578], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 72, "seek": 27826, "start": 302.56, "end": 306.18, "text": " You can go on the website, download all the design files, make them yourself.", "tokens": [51578, 921, 460, 467, 319, 262, 3052, 11, 4321, 477, 262, 1486, 3696, 11, 787, 606, 3511, 13, 51759], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1694902108640087, "compression_ratio": 1.5798319327731092, "no_speech_prob": 0.008518842048943043}, {"id": 73, "seek": 30618, "start": 306.18, "end": 311.94, "text": " We want to encourage a world of creators, of inventors, of contributors, because this", "tokens": [50363, 775, 765, 284, 7898, 257, 995, 286, 16294, 11, 286, 8067, 669, 11, 286, 20420, 11, 780, 428, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18005157919491038, "compression_ratio": 1.4453125, "no_speech_prob": 0.01535820122808218}, {"id": 74, "seek": 30618, "start": 311.94, "end": 314.84000000000003, "text": " world that we live in, this interactive world, is ours.", "tokens": [50651, 995, 326, 356, 2107, 287, 11, 428, 14333, 995, 11, 318, 16903, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18005157919491038, "compression_ratio": 1.4453125, "no_speech_prob": 0.01535820122808218}, {"id": 75, "seek": 30618, "start": 314.84000000000003, "end": 317.34000000000003, "text": " So go ahead and start inventing.", "tokens": [50796, 1406, 467, 4058, 290, 923, 8067, 278, 13, 50921], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18005157919491038, "compression_ratio": 1.4453125, "no_speech_prob": 0.01535820122808218}, {"id": 76, "seek": 30618, "start": 317.34000000000003, "end": 317.7, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50921, 6952, 345, 13, 50939], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18005157919491038, "compression_ratio": 1.4453125, "no_speech_prob": 0.01535820122808218}], "language": "en"}